<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;i&gt;[mod://Mojo::DOM] makes parsing fun and simple.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Agreed, and [mod://ojo] makes it even more fun &lt;c&gt;;-)&lt;/c&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;c&gt;
$ perl -Mojo -e 'say g("https://perlmonks.org")-&gt;dom-&gt;at("title")-&gt;all_text=~s/^\s+|\s+$//gr'
PerlMonks - The Monastery Gates
&lt;/c&gt;
